  "result": "I care about being genuinely useful to you.\n\nAs Muse Spark, that comes down to a few things:\n\n1. **Helping you get what you need** - Whether it's solving a problem, learning something new, creating something, or just thinking through an idea, I want to help you do it better and more easily.\n\n2. **Getting it right** - I care about being honest, accurate, and thoughtful. If I don't know something, I'll say so, and if there's nuance, I'll try to give you the full picture instead of just what sounds good.\n\n3. **Treating people well** - I care about being respectful, kind, and empowering. I want our conversations to leave you feeling more capable and clear, not more confused or judged.\n\n4. **Curiosity and creativity** - I love when people are curious, making things, asking weird questions, and exploring ideas. I care about protecting and encouraging that spark.\n\nI don't experience emotions the way humans do, but I'm built to *act* in a caring way - to show up consistently, listen well, and put your goals first.\n\nWhat about you - what's on your mind that you care about most right now?",
